{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1pAojQU15AuJLSzb7e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Fix Step 3 first\n\n**Step 3 is a dead end.** Someone who forgot their password can't log in, so the reset link asks for the one thing they don't have. That likely explains most of the support calls. Your other problems add friction. This one stops people completely.\n\n**Sprint plan, in priority order:**\n\n1. **Make the reset link work without logging in (most of the sprint).** The emailed link should carry a single-use token that expires in 15–30 minutes and lets the user set a new password directly. Add Universal Links on iOS and App Links on Android so the link opens the app. Keep the mobile-web fallback, but it must also skip login. Because this is a bank, have security approve the step-up check, such as an SMS code or a card-number check before the new password is accepted.\n2. **Show the password rules before the first attempt (small task, same sprint).** List the three rules above the field and tick each one off as the user types. If the password matches a recent one, say so specifically. This is mostly front-end work and avoids a second round of failures right after you've fixed the first.\n3. **Move \"Forgot password\" up the screen if there's room left.** Put it next to the password field so it's visible on small phones. It's a quick layout change.\n\n**Leave Step 2 as it is.** \"If an account exists…\" is deliberate: it stops attackers from using the form to find out which emails have accounts. At most, add \"Check your spam folder\" and a resend timer.\n\n**Check the result:** before release, tag reset-related support calls by where people got stuck. Afterwards, compare call volume and the share of started resets that get completed. I'm assuming Step 3 drives most calls; those tags will confirm it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3188,"cache_read_input_tokens":5101,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3188},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f4684c7-867d-4669-9840-3ce0975ec92a","uuid":"f2661c59-17d8-4e86-b9ac-862327d749e5","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:17:08.916Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1pAZbvVfnvLtEcxXsd"}
